{"slug":"Evade-Auto-Walk-131273","_id":"69ac006096d3ccea10062e65","title":"Auto Walk","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d88","gameId":9872472334,"name":"Evade ","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":9872472334},"features":"Make Your character walks by itself \nMOVE_DIRECTION = Vector3.new(0, 0, 1) = backwards \nMOVE_DIRECTION = Vector3.new(0, 0, -1) = frontwards \nMOVE_DIRECTION = Vector3.new(-1, 0, 0) = left \nMOVE_DIRECTION = Vector3.new(1, 0, 0)  =right\nyou can use this to create bot player for auto farming if you never wanted to get ban","tags":[],"script":"local Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal Player = Players.LocalPlayer\n\nautoWalkEnabled = true\nMOVE_DIRECTION = Vector3.new(0, 0, 1)\n\nfunction setupInputOverride()\n\tlocal success, controlModule = pcall(function()\n\t\treturn require(Player:WaitForChild(\"PlayerScripts\"):WaitForChild(\"PlayerModule\"):WaitForChild(\"ControlModule\"))\n\tend)\n\tif success and controlModule then\n\t\tlocal old = controlModule.GetMoveVector\n\t\tcontrolModule.GetMoveVector = function(...)\n\t\t\tif autoWalkEnabled then\n\t\t\t\tlocal input = old(...)\n\t\t\t\treturn input.Magnitude > 0.1 and input or MOVE_DIRECTION\n\t\t\tend\n\t\t\treturn old(...)\n\t\tend\n\tend\nend\n\ntask.spawn(setupInputOverride)","owner":{"_id":"694f2f1540f162cbcf8c2685","username":"ItzPnsdg","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/f8dcd1247188e7562d3b0d7bdf4ae6adac67f2e57ed48bc391b99e1329638256.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/694f2f1540f162cbcf8c2685-1773032095603.jpg"},"lvl":10,"status":"offline","id":"694f2f1540f162cbcf8c2685","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":100000},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/f8dcd1247188e7562d3b0d7bdf4ae6adac67f2e57ed48bc391b99e1329638256.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/694f